eted":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I have the following class:\r\n\r\n```php\r\nabstract class AbstractEventListener\r\n{\r\n    /**\r\n     * @param AbstractEvent $event\r\n     *\r\n     * @return void\r\n     */\r\n    public function handleEvent(AbstractEvent $event)\r\n    {\r\n        $handleMethod = [$this, 'handle' . $event->getType()];\r\n\r\n        if (is_callable($handleMethod)) {\r\n            $handleMethod($event);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt gives me the following error, which I think is not correct:\r\n\r\n```\r\nTypeDoesNotContainType - src/Application/AbstractEventListener.php:19:13 - Cannot resolve types for $handleMethod - array<int, string|Redacted\\Namespace\\AbstractEventListener> does not contain callable\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/247/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.